{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.WedderburnMass.confinement_categorical","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.confinement_categorical","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.confinement_categorical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.confinement_categorical","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L98-L145","doc":"**Categorical confinement** ([`prop:confinement-categorical`]).\n\nThe three clauses — survival on `E_∞^{0,0}`, factorisation of the\nFrobenius integral through the centre projector, and centrality of\nphysical observables — hold for the categorical-confinement data.\n\nThe proof requires the semisimple-algebra Hochschild vanishing\n(`HH^k(A) = 0`, `k ≥ 1`) and the Wedderburn decomposition of `A`,\nneither of which is in Mathlib.\n\n## 🛑 The tripwire in this docstring fired, and nobody was watching (2026-09-03)\n\nThe paragraph that stood here said the body was \"an honest `sorry` + `-- Ref:`\",\nthat \"no class field posits this conclusion, so the statement cannot be\ndischarged by projection\", and — as an explicit alarm —\n\n> *\"Verify with `#print axioms`, which must report `sorryAx`; if it ever stops\n> doing so without this docstring changing, the projection has come back.\"*\n\n**That is exactly what happened.** The body is `ctx.confinement_ident`, a class\nfield carrying the whole three-clause conclusion, and the prescribed check now\nreports\n\n    'QOU.WedderburnMass.confinement_categorical' depends on axioms:\n      [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n\nwith **no `sorryAx`**. The projection came back, the docstring did not change,\nand the alarm went unread until the `proof-docstring-sorry-mismatch` audit\nflagged the file.\n\n**Why only the prose is corrected here.** Restoring the `sorry` the docstring\ndemands would propagate `sorryAx` to this theorem's external consumers, which is\na change to proof content rather than to documentation; the projection itself is\nthe `proof-no-self-assuming-projection` question tracked in bean `qou-z9ws` and\nowned elsewhere. What is fixed is the false claim.\n\n**Keep the tripwire, and read it.** The check above is still the right test —\nits failure mode was never the test, it was that nothing ran it. The audit now\ndoes: `bun run content/pipeline/lean-vacuity-axiom-audit.ts`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-categorical","label":"prop:confinement-categorical","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-categorical.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.confinement_ident","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.confinement_ident","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L93-L93","doc":"Missing input: confinement categorical ident ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.observable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.observable","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L91-L91","doc":"Predicate \"`x : A` is a physical observable\" — survives the\nGB-filtration spectral sequence collapse. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.pi_centre","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.pi_centre","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L88-L88","doc":"Projector onto the center of `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.integral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.integral","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L86-L86","doc":"Frobenius integral evaluated on an arbitrary algebra element.  `∫_A`\nis the `R`-linear Frobenius form of the symmetric algebra `A`, so it\nlands in `R`, not in `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.E_infinity_00","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.E_infinity_00","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L82-L82","doc":"Total `E_∞^{0,0}` contribution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.e_block","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.e_block","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Per-block contribution to the `E_∞^{0,0}` page (`R · e_λ`\nscalar coefficient), valued in the inherited coefficient ring `R` of\nthe parent Markov-trace context — the very `R` the proposition's\n`E_∞^{0,0} = Z(A) = ⊕_λ R·e_λ` names. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.n_blocks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.n_blocks","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Number of Wedderburn blocks (partitions of `n`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.toMarkovTraceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext.toMarkovTraceContext","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L73-L96","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ConfinementCategoricalContext","kind":"class","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/confinement_categorical.lean#L64-L96","doc":"Structural data for the categorical-confinement proposition.\n\nCarries only the *inputs*: the Hecke algebra `A` (via the parent\nMarkov-trace context), the number of Wedderburn blocks, the per-block\ncentral-idempotent scalars, the total `E_∞^{0,0}` contribution, the\nFrobenius integral, the centre projector, and the\n\"is a physical observable\" predicate.  It does **not** assert the\nproposition's conclusions — those are stated and proved (modulo\n`sorry`) by `confinement_categorical` below. ","signatureChunk":0}]}